{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15400","headline":"夜宴虢县张明府宅逢宇文评事 · 李端","name":"夜宴虢县张明府宅逢宇文评事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"虢田留古宅，入夜足秋风。\n月影来窗里，灯光落水中。\n徵诗逢谢客，饮酒得陶公。\n更爱疎篱下，繁霜湿菊丛。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李端","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15400.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15400","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}